  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Wish You Were Here**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2016-10-27.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 133 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Listener describes the audience recording as solid and notes the room has a great sound [5]\n- **mmj2016-10-27.4023_4028.flac24**: source not stated; 20 songs; 135 min [3]\n- **mmj2016-10-27.4023_4028.flac16**: source not stated; 20 songs; 135 min [4]\n- **MMJ2016-10-27**: source not stated; 20 songs; 133 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2016-10-27.flac24**: taped by Marty Loving; transferred by Marty Loving; source: Source: Beyer CK950(DIN)> Lunatec V2> Tascam DR-680 @ 24/48 [1]\n- **mmj2016-10-27.4023_4028.flac24**: Recorded with DPA 4023 and 4028 mics into Lunatec and Sonosax preamps; Captured from Orchestra Center Row H Seat 1, then converted to 24/96 FLAC [3]\n- **mmj2016-10-27.4023_4028.flac16**: Recorded with DPA 4023 and 4028 mics into Lunatec and Sonosax preamps; Captured from Orchestra Center Row H Seat 1, then dithered to 16/44.1 FLAC [4]\n- **MMJ2016-10-27**: taped by poppag76; transferred by poppag76; source: Berliner CM33-> USBPre2->HDP2 [2]",
